{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/blinkidverify\/documentcapturemodulesettings\/inputimageselectionstrategy"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify","doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the strategy used to select the best input image from a pool of stable input images."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13BlinkIDVerify27InputImageSelectionStrategyO","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/InputImageSelectionStrategy"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before selecting the best quality image, a sequence of stable input images must be available. From this pool of input images,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the one with the highest quality is selected. An input image is considered stable if the image analysis results are consistent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"across consecutive stream of input images."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A larger pool size increases the likelihood of capturing a high-quality image but may introduce a slight delay,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as more stable input images need to be collected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Available strategies are: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SingleImage"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptimizeForSpeed"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Balanced"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptimizeForQuality"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Default strategy represents a trade-off between speed and quality, while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptimizeForSpeed"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptimizeForQuality"},{"type":"text","text":" represent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strategies optimized for speed and quality, respectively."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This setting is applicable only for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Video"},{"type":"text","text":" input image source."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings\/inputImageSelectionStrategy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","modules":[{"name":"BlinkIDVerify"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13BlinkIDVerify27InputImageSelectionStrategyO"}],"externalID":"s:13BlinkIDVerify29DocumentCaptureModuleSettingsV27inputImageSelectionStrategyAA05InputhiJ0Ovp"},"references":{"doc://com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify/documentation/BlinkIDVerify/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"DocumentCaptureModuleSettings","url":"\/documentation\/blinkidverify\/documentcapturemodulesettings","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentCaptureModuleSettings"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Settings for the document capture module."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentCaptureModuleSettings"}]},"doc://com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify/documentation/BlinkIDVerify/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings/inputImageSelectionStrategy":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the strategy used to select the best input image from a pool of stable input images."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings\/inputImageSelectionStrategy","title":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13BlinkIDVerify27InputImageSelectionStrategyO","text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/blinkidverify\/documentcapturemodulesettings\/inputimageselectionstrategy"},"doc://com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify/documentation/BlinkIDVerify":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/blinkidverify","title":"BlinkIDVerify","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify/documentation/BlinkIDVerify/InputImageSelectionStrategy":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkIDVerify\/documentation\/BlinkIDVerify\/InputImageSelectionStrategy","title":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Represents the strategy used to select the best input image from a pool of stable input images.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum